Z||000008||Neal||11-06-2001||10:56 PM||||That bike is garbage, garentee you that the cheap disc brakes wont lock the wheel if your life depended on it.  The suspension wont work and your gonna pray for the afformentioned "wet fart" cause it will feel smoother then...<P>and if you ever consider riding it on more than just pathways your gonna break the swinarm...<P>I could go on but i wont, but at the price your looking at, do yourself a favour and dont consider rear suspension or disc brakes.<P>Go to a professional bike shop and look at some of the cheaper bikes they carry, you wont be dissapointed.||||reg||13
